    <sys:String x:Key="LOCDisplayManager_AboutTab">Informazioni</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCDisplayManager_AboutDescription">Display Manager applica un profilo schermo e HDR di Windows all’avvio di un gioco e ripristina lo stato precedente del Desktop alla chiusura, pensato per configurazioni HTPC / divano in Playnite Desktop e Fullscreen.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCDisplayManager_AboutPurposeTitle">Cosa fa Display Manager</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCDisplayManager_AboutDisplays">Choose which display a game uses, rename monitors with EDID-stable identity, and trial display layout changes with automatic restore.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCDisplayManager_AboutProfiles">Own HDR with global policies, Features/Tags metadata matching, and per-game overrides. Optional refresh-rate changes restore with the display snapshot.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCDisplayManager_AboutIntegration">Pannello superiore Desktop, Theme API per temi Fullscreen e RestoreHost se Playnite si chiude in modo imprevisto.</sys:String>
